---

Two files of this crate are Formray's own and follow no upstream code:
`src/checkpoint.rs` (reading the PyTorch checkpoint) and `src/tempo.rs`
(the rule from beats to one BPM and its abstentions). Besides the MIT
licence above, they are also offered under the Apache License, Version 2.0,
at your option, like the rest of disctale-bpm-key-detector.
